<title>USA: Farm Family Holdings Q3 net up, shr drops.</title>
<headline>Farm Family Holdings Q3 net up, shr drops.</headline>
<dateline>GLENMONT, N.Y. 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.72		    $1.06</p>
<p> Net			  3,336		    3,173</p>
<p> Revs			37,264		   34,145</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   4,641		    3,000</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.92		    $2.69</p>
<p> Net			  5,275		    8,201</p>
<p> Revs		     109,180		   98,500</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   3,553		    3,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE Company converted to a stock company from a mutual company on July 26, 1996. 1996 period results include expenses of $126,000 in Q3 and $1.5 million in the nine-month period for conversion to a stock company.</p>
<p>Q3 earnings per share excluding capital gains and losses: $0.76 vs $0.99.</p>
<p>Nine month earnings per share excluding capital gains and losses: $1.92 vs $2.69.</p>
